  "description": "Access to the Como corridor has never been this attainable. Presenting a bright and fresh, top floor, 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom unit that offers the serenity of the beautiful McDougal Park, situated in the \"Lake View\" complex this property is perfect for the first home buyer who is looking for the convenience and comfort of the Como postcode.<br/><br/>Spread over an open planned living, a generous sized kitchen is ideal for who is looking to get creative in the kitchen, offering good-sized cupboards, drawers and breakfast bar. Adjacent to the kitchen is the tidy dining area, ideal for entertaining.<br/><br/>Conveniently positioned on opposite ends of the bedrooms is the lounge room, equipped with split system air-conditioning, wooden venetian blinds and balcony lookout.<br/>Walking out to the balcony you are met with a picturesque view of lush greenery and lake views. A superb morning coffee or evening beverage spot.<br/><br/>The bright, spacious master bedroom is fitted with a character style ceiling fan, private window views of the park<br/>Second bedroom is ideal for a home office or guest bedroom.<br/><br/>The crisp white bathroom is spacious and nicely set up for comfort and practicality, equipped with a corner shower and combining the large laundry provisions with basin and storage.<br/><br/>Key Features;<br/>• NBN available<br/>• Balcony with lake views<br/>• King size master bedroom<br/>• Reverse cycle air-conditioner<br/>• One Exclusive shaded Car Bay plus extra parking areas<br/>• Outdoor entertainment seating area<br/>• Affordable outgoings<br/>• Bus access to the city<br/>• Freeway access to North & South",
